@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-27 - Soft Delete Product

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Products UI" as FE
control "ShoesController" as API
control "ShoesService" as Service
database "MongoDB: shoes, shoesDetail, counters" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-27
FE -> API: POST /shoes/soft-delete/:productId
API -> Service: Execute Soft Delete Product
Service -> DB: Read/write shoes, shoesDetail, counters
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Sản phẩm bị ẩn khỏi store (stock = 0)

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Sản phẩm tồn tại
Post: Sản phẩm bị ẩn khỏi store (stock = 0)
Main flow:
1. Admin vào /admin/products
2. Admin chọn sản phẩm
3. Admin bấm Delete (soft delete)
4. System gọi API DELETE /shoes/product/:id
5. System set stock = 0 cho tất cả variants (giữ data)
end note
@enduml
